---
// Uber's log platform, Elasticsearch to ClickHouse (Wang and Li, 2021).
// Every number is from the post's text: >80% aggregations, 5% of indexed fields used,
// compression 3x (up to 30x), 300K logs/s per node (about 10x an Elasticsearch node),
// hardware cost down by more than half. ClickHouse has no logo in the icon kit, so the
// generic db icon stands in. Plain inline SVG with site tokens, no ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 438;
const gain = [
  { x: 20, en: ['3x compression', 'up to 30x in some cases'], vi: ['Nén 3 lần', 'có trường hợp tới 30 lần'], icon: 'disk' as const },
  { x: 314, en: ['300K logs per second', 'per node, about 10x Elasticsearch'], vi: ['300 nghìn log mỗi giây', 'mỗi node, gấp ~10 lần Elasticsearch'], icon: 'stopwatch' as const },
  { x: 608, en: ['Hardware cost', 'down by more than half'], vi: ['Chi phí phần cứng', 'giảm hơn một nửa'], icon: 'money' as const },
];
---
<figure class="ul">
  <div class="ul-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Uber's log platform moved from Elasticsearch to ClickHouse because more than 80 percent of queries were aggregations and only 5 percent of indexed fields were used. Afterwards compression was 3x, one node ingested 300K logs per second about ten times an Elasticsearch node, and hardware cost fell by more than half.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="ul-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Why Uber's log platform changed engines (2021)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao nền tảng log của Uber đổi engine (2021)</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="56" class="ul-step">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. What the queries looked like</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Truy vấn trông thế nào</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="66" width="420" height="64" rx="4" class="ul-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={50} y={98} size={30} />
    <text x="82" y="94" class="ul-in">
      <tspan data-lang-en>More than 80% were aggregations</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hơn 80% là truy vấn tổng hợp</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="82" y="114" class="ul-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>counts, histograms, percentiles</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đếm, histogram, phân vị</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="460" y="66" width="420" height="64" rx="4" class="ul-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="index" x={490} y={98} size={30} />
    <text x="522" y="94" class="ul-in">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Only 5% of indexed fields were used</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ 5% số trường có index được dùng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="522" y="114" class="ul-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>indexing every field was mostly wasted</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đánh index mọi trường phần lớn là thừa</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="168" class="ul-step">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. So they moved the logs</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Nên họ chuyển log sang engine khác</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="180" width="330" height="64" rx="4" class="ul-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="elasticsearch" x={52} y={212} size={32} />
    <text x="84" y="208" class="ul-in">Elasticsearch</text>
    <text x="84" y="228" class="ul-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>indexes the fields</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đánh index các trường</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d="M350,212 L543,212" class="ul-arrow" /><polygon points="542,207 542,217 550,212" class="ul-head" />
    <rect x="550" y="180" width="330" height="64" rx="4" class="ul-box is-hit" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={582} y={212} size={32} />
    <text x="614" y="208" class="ul-in">ClickHouse</text>
    <text x="614" y="228" class="ul-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>column store</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>database lưu theo cột</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="282" class="ul-step">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3. What they report afterwards</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Kết quả họ báo sau đó</tspan>
    </text>
    {gain.map((g) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={g.x} y="294" width="272" height="80" rx="4" class="ul-box is-hit" />
        <DiagramIcon name={g.icon} x={g.x + 28} y={334} size={28} />
        <text x={g.x + 54} y="326" class="ul-in">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{g.en[0]}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{g.vi[0]}</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x={g.x + 54} y="346" class="ul-in-s">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{g.en[1]}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{g.vi[1]}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="396" y2="396" class="ul-rule" />
    <text x="20" y="420" class="ul-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Figures are as reported in Chao Wang and Xiaobing Li's 2021 post for Uber.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Số liệu theo bài năm 2021 của Chao Wang và Xiaobing Li cho Uber.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Most queries just counted things across many rows, and few indexed fields were ever used. That is the work a column store is built for.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Phần lớn truy vấn chỉ đếm trên nhiều dòng, và rất ít trường có index được dùng tới. Đó đúng là việc column store sinh ra để làm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ul { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ul-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ul svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ul text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .ul .ul-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ul .ul-step { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ul-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .ul-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ul-box.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ul .ul-in { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .ul .ul-in-m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .ul .ul-in-s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .ul .ul-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ul-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .ul-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ul figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
